/-- the four raters differ in what they do with the single small local event (S), not with forecast, plan or warning -/
theorem same_on_fpw : ∀ ys, ys = sonnet ∨ ys = qwen ∨ ys = gemma ∨ ys = jev → count V.F ys + count V.P ys + count V.W ys = 0 := by
